     <actual value="3"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Government with enhancing cyber security of the critical infrastructure in the energy sector</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to conduct seven audits of critical energy infrastructure, institutional capacity building and support the Government in developing a regulatory framework to enhance resilience against cyber threats, particularly given the political volatility and vulnerabilities of the energy system. The energy sector specifically lacks an enabling environment for adequate cybersecurity measures. These efforts will help attract investments, strengthen the security of critical infrastructure, and ensure protection against cyber threats by promoting the use of advanced security technologies, such as intrusion detection systems, firewalls, and encryption technologies.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2024"></baseline>
